{
  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows hydroxocobalamin injection from BTG International Inc. and Teva Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc. as Current since 2024-11-04; our supply traces to a label naming Hikma Farmaceutica (Portugal) S.A. as the manufacturing plant",
  "headline_cites": ["E4", "E5", "E3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows hydroxocobalamin injection from BTG International Inc. and Teva Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc. as Current, first posted 2024-11-04 and updated 2026-10-19 and 2026-10-15 respectively.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage has been on FDA's list for 24 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our inventory at both Corvale East and Corvale General carries NDC 00591288830 labeled by Actavis Pharma, Inc., and the product label names Hikma Farmaceutica (Portugal) S.A. 2705-906 Terrugem SNT as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no public FDA inspection classification (OAI, VAI, or NAI) or other signal for that plant in the evidence provided.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 5.1 days on hand (20 vials at 3.9 vials per day) and Corvale General has 18.7 days on hand (75 vials at 4 vials per day).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked action is to transfer 18 vials of 1000 ug/mL, 30 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would leave Corvale General with 14 days and bring Corvale East to 10 days.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
